# Applied on every deploy (including CLI --dir deploys, where netlify.toml
# [[headers]] are not processed). These files are embedded on third-party
# dealer sites, so allow any origin and keep a short cache — a fix propagates
# within minutes while ETags still give cheap 304s.
/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=300, must-revalidate
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
